        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: King of Norway, King Magnus\n- Places: Southern Isles, this region\n- Concepts: Norse names, political independence, military campaigns\n\nFacts:\n- The Norse knew this region as the Southern Isles.\n- This region was at times independent of external control.\n- A King of Norway launched aggressive military campaigns in this region.\n- King Magnus' Halt railway station was named after that King of Norway.",
